1.List in strings-it is a group of data/or datatypes
eg-
name="Mark"
age=20
marks=70.5
-instead of this we can create a list to store data
student=["John",20,70.4]
*it also has index number from 0 to n

2.Operation of list
#slicing of list
-same as slicing of string

#concatenation of lists
-to add 2 or more list
l1=[1,2,3]
l2=[4,5]
l3=l1+l2

#repeatation of list
print(l2 *3)

#function of list
1.append
-to add new item at end of list
-syntax:list.append(item)

2.insert
-to add item at specific position
syntax:list.insert(index,item)
